  "description": "Operational-database IDataSource companion for ToolUp.Platform: one connector spanning PostgreSQL, MySQL/MariaDB, SQL Server (and Azure SQL), SQLite, Oracle and ClickHouse, selected per data source by the ConnectionScope 'backend' key. Catalogue introspection via information_schema / ALL_TAB_COLUMNS / pragma_table_info; query results returned as RFC 4180 CSV; passwords resolved per call through ISecretStore.",
